Note on the legislative corpus: the Bulgarian normative acts contained in this
repository (the Markdown texts under laws/, codes/, ordinances/, implementing/,
regulations/ and postanovleniya/) are official acts of state bodies. Under
чл. 4, т. 1 of the Bulgarian Закон за авторското право и сродните му права
(ЗАПСП), normative and individual acts of state governance bodies, acts of the
courts, and their official translations are not objects of copyright. The MIT
license above applies to the software, tooling, documentation, and data
structures of this project; the legislative texts themselves are in the public
domain as official acts. The consolidated versions provided here are unofficial
consolidations and carry no claim of authenticity — the authoritative source is
Държавен вестник.
